('admin.membership.assign.intro', 'zh-CN', '归属按「工程 + 访客账号」唯一。日结按累计消费额自动升级那些来源为「自动重算」的行；这里手工指定的行不会被自动重算覆盖，要交还自动重算请点该行的「解除锁定」。还没有归属行的访客按工程的默认等级计算 —— 那个值不在这张表里，它是解析时的内存兜底。', 200, 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html', 1, now(), now()),
('admin.membership.assign.intro', 'en-US', 'An assignment is unique per project plus customer account. The daily run upgrades rows whose source is Automatic based on cumulative spend; a row assigned by hand here is never overwritten by it - use Unlock on that row to hand it back. Customers with no assignment row fall back to the project default tier at resolution time; that fallback is never stored in this table.', 200, 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html', 1, now(), now()),
('admin.membership.assign.recalcUnavailable', 'zh-CN', '自动升级尚未启用：消费额数据源（订单侧的批量聚合）还没接入，日结不会运行；这里的归属只能手工维护。', 200, 'admin', 'internal/templates/admin/membership/*.html', 1, now(), now()),
